{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922025425_6772e77e","chunk_index":2,"job_id":"mwjob_6ea88e6715579409992c43ee","precondition_digest":"968aabd6184f764b8be1b297092e19b0d5f45b861c3a384214982b8cdb9452d9","project_id":"proj_user_8a5a00cb014a","schema_version":"protocol_full_draft_chunk_v7","section_ids":["mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_2b3b651762037aa3","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_0d1c72ba25343e73","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_cf9127212cfac33d","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_650a3ed48fbc8ff8"],"sections":[{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922025425_6772e77e","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"研究题目：合成试验药A用于治疗成人中重度斑块状银屑病的III期临床研究\n试验药物：合成试验药A\n适应症：成人中重度斑块状银屑病\n研究分期：III期\n开发区域：中国\n内在研究目的：确证性研究","quote_sha256":"8269c0ca3715091483ef89708c04da728479327d520e21f17020f5b5783f5b89","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_curr_identity"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"药物技术类型：small_molecule\n给药途径：口服\n剂型：口服固体制剂\n局部/系统暴露范围：systemic","quote_sha256":"93d70823288385813f38b773b8c6e7bba227a7ed893796844d8834e9f3bae884","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_curr_drug"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"试验干预：试验组接受合成试验药A 100 mg口服，每日一次，连续16周；对照组接受匹配安慰剂。\n剂量与给药方案：合成试验药A：100 mg，每日一次（QD）（口服）；第1天至第16周。依从：通过药品计数及受试者日记评价依从性\n匹配安慰剂：每日一次（QD）（口服）；第1天至第16周双盲治疗期。依从：通过药品计数及受试者日记评价依从性","quote_sha256":"593bba668c7b8876ab4fde41e75ef3db582fd7354f8205c66132c569107988ac","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_curr_intervention"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"总体研究设计：平行组（parallel assignment）、双盲、安慰剂对照、随机\n目标研究人群：成人中重度斑块状银屑病患者\n随机化方式：随机分配\n对照措施：匹配安慰剂\n分配模型：平行组（parallel assignment）\n中心模式：多中心","quote_sha256":"9546677f90c38af4d30a7b2ba79669a1527fc3fc8f8caced3e12f9f4b35c0ec4","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_curr_design"},{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:307fc85bddcdf9ac984820c5","quote":"章节编号=2.3\n章节标题=研究药物简介\n章节类型=section\n当前正文=合成试验药A","quote_sha256":"b4bd486112a1a44995254d2e9f782bfadf90ba0f1a8bbab02be567e32862a26c","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:307fc85bddcdf9ac984820c5","span_id":"span_sel_23"}],"evidence_span_ids":["span_curr_identity","span_curr_drug","span_curr_intervention","span_curr_design","span_sel_23"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":4},"heading":"研究药物简介","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"合成试验药A为本研究的试验药物，拟用于成人中重度斑块状银屑病，研究分期为III期，开发区域为中国。该药属于小分子药物，经口服途径给药，剂型为口服固体制剂，具有全身暴露特征。本研究采用平行组、双盲、安慰剂对照及随机分配设计。试验组受试者接受合成试验药A 100 mg口服，每日一次，自第1天至第16周；对照组受试者接受匹配安慰剂，给药频率为每日一次，治疗期同样为第1天至第16周。匹配安慰剂对照、1:1随机分配及16周双盲治疗期共同构成双盲比较条件。研究期间通过药品计数及受试者日记评价受试者依从性。","rationale":"本章节依据已确认的试验药物身份、小分子口服固体制剂、100 mg每日一次口服至第16周、匹配安慰剂及依从性评价方式撰写。需医学作者核对匹配安慰剂的外观、包装、贮存与药物管理细节。","review_advisories":["本节重复了多项总体设计事实；建议压缩为与本节直接相关的信息。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_2b3b651762037aa3","section_number":"2.3","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:307fc85bddcdf9ac984820c5","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:b5cb8043e0359e","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:367cbc36976ba5","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:7252de902642cb","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:d84680fc442c0c"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922025425_6772e77e","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"heading":"非临床研究结果","missing_source_classes":["研究药物非临床研究资料（药理学、毒理学、药代动力学）","研究者手册或非临床研究报告"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"该章节当前为空，且现有来源未提供合成试验药A的药理学、毒理学或药代动力学非临床研究资料，无法形成实质正文；需医学作者核对并补充相应非临床来源。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_0d1c72ba25343e73","section_number":"2.3.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:307fc85bddcdf9ac984820c5","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:b5cb8043e0359e","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:367cbc36976ba5","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:7252de902642cb","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:d84680fc442c0c"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922025425_6772e77e","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"heading":"既往临床研究结果","missing_source_classes":["既往临床研究资料（临床研究报告、已发表文献）","研究者手册中既往人体研究总结","研究药物既往临床安全性及疗效数据"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"该章节当前为空，且现有来源未提供合成试验药A的既往临床研究资料，包括既往人体研究结果、已发表文献或研究者手册中的相关总结；需医学作者核对并补充相应临床来源。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_cf9127212cfac33d","section_number":"2.3.2","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:307fc85bddcdf9ac984820c5","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:b5cb8043e0359e","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:367cbc36976ba5","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:7252de902642cb","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:d84680fc442c0c"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922025425_6772e77e","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"研究题目：合成试验药A用于治疗成人中重度斑块状银屑病的III期临床研究\n试验药物：合成试验药A\n适应症：成人中重度斑块状银屑病\n研究分期：III期\n开发区域：中国\n内在研究目的：确证性研究","quote_sha256":"8269c0ca3715091483ef89708c04da728479327d520e21f17020f5b5783f5b89","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_curr_identity"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"总体研究设计：平行组（parallel assignment）、双盲、安慰剂对照、随机\n目标研究人群：成人中重度斑块状银屑病患者\n随机化方式：随机分配\n对照措施：匹配安慰剂\n分配模型：平行组（parallel assignment）\n中心模式：多中心","quote_sha256":"9546677f90c38af4d30a7b2ba79669a1527fc3fc8f8caced3e12f9f4b35c0ec4","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_curr_design"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"研究人群概述：确诊为斑块状银屑病、疾病严重程度为中重度的成人受试者。\n入选标准模块：年龄≥18岁；确诊斑块状银屑病≥6个月；筛选及基线时PASI≥12、受累体表面积≥10%、sPGA≥3；适合接受系统治疗或光疗。","quote_sha256":"f0b5cae7f3744ab49217bebf046dfbf7a98d20563e6cbf3e22f7bb2ef54b5209","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_curr_pop"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"主要研究目的：评价合成试验药A相较安慰剂治疗成人中重度斑块状银屑病的疗效。\n次要研究目的：评价合成试验药A对皮损清除程度及皮肤病相关生活质量的影响。","quote_sha256":"2ac5414e5b404b58a36cba216311b70c374adcc64fbb813ea19e5451f68e54f8","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_curr_objectives"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"主要终点：第16周达到PASI 75应答（较基线PASI评分改善≥75%）的受试者比例。\n关键次要终点：第16周sPGA达到0或1且较基线改善≥2级的受试者比例。；第16周达到PASI 90应答的受试者比例。\n其他次要终点：第16周PASI评分较基线的变化。；第16周DLQI评分较基线的变化。","quote_sha256":"ba197eabab40b7879a440065c2250c0972b6f127dcd39f273ef81d0cdb8222df","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_curr_endpoints"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"研究时期：筛选期：最长4周。；双盲治疗期：16周。；安全性随访期：4周。\n访视策略：筛选后于基线/第1天随机；第2、4、8、12、16周进行治疗期访视，第20周进行安全性随访。PASI和sPGA于基线及第4、8、12、16周评价。","quote_sha256":"dfda1e4a5c0bdfbbd1df9055000d3fa32a4447873b567ad83536040bced2e908","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_curr_periods"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"样本量策略：假设第16周PASI 75应答率试验组为60%、安慰剂组为30%，双侧α=0.05、把握度90%、1:1随机，并考虑15%脱落，共计划入组132例（每组66例）。","quote_sha256":"2088842f2548655845b43f017bb904dc2663a94d1a5c7a802e7adf8daa68b0d2","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_curr_sample"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"统计分析策略：全分析集按随机分组采用CMH方法比较主要终点，报告应答率差、95%置信区间和P值，以优效性为目标。主要缺失处理采用无应答填补，并以多重插补和观察病例分析进行敏感性分析；安全性集按实际治疗分析。不开展期中分析。","quote_sha256":"ccd7b348358b71793f3761994bf0e928e73abcd319f577b74f5285d5c99e3b7c","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_curr_analysis"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"安全性终点：治疗期间出现的不良事件（TEAE）、严重不良事件及导致停药的不良事件发生率。；实验室检查、生命体征及12导联心电图具有临床意义的变化。","quote_sha256":"99133b9298d6b094501b14430ac89a3b690a9aa9acb4bb1df325ea3196a44236","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_curr_safety"},{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:307fc85bddcdf9ac984820c5","quote":"章节编号=2.4\n章节标题=本研究的理论基础\n章节类型=section\n当前正文=确证性研究","quote_sha256":"254b989573481ef69049cb53a90ea720889b9c2394652c9fa93aa918d68f42ee","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:307fc85bddcdf9ac984820c5","span_id":"span_sel_24"}],"evidence_span_ids":["span_curr_identity","span_curr_design","span_curr_pop","span_curr_objectives","span_curr_endpoints","span_curr_periods","span_curr_sample","span_curr_analysis","span_curr_safety","span_sel_24"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":9},"heading":"本研究的理论基础","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究为确证性III期临床研究，拟在成人中重度斑块状银屑病患者中评价合成试验药A相较安慰剂的疗效。采用平行组、双盲、安慰剂对照及随机分配设计，以支持在控制偏倚的条件下进行组间比较。目标研究人群为确诊斑块状银屑病且疾病严重程度为中重度的成人受试者；入选标准要求年龄≥18岁、确诊斑块状银屑病≥6个月，筛选及基线时PASI≥12、受累体表面积≥10%、sPGA≥3，且适合接受系统治疗或光疗。主要研究目的为评价合成试验药A相较安慰剂的疗效，次要研究目的为评价皮损清除程度及皮肤病相关生活质量的影响。疗效评价围绕第16周PASI 75应答设置主要终点，并以第16周sPGA达到0或1且较基线改善≥2级、第16周PASI 90应答以及第16周PASI评分和DLQI评分较基线的变化作为次要评价内容。双盲治疗期为16周，主要疗效评价时点为第16周。研究采用随机、双盲、安慰剂对照的平行组设计，并按1:1随机分配至试验药组或匹配安慰剂组；样本量估计基于主要疗效终点的预期组间应答差异并考虑脱落，不开展期中分析。上述研究设计要素共同构成本研究以确证性方式评价合成试验药A治疗成人中重度斑块状银屑病疗效和安全性的理论基础。","rationale":"本章节依据确证性III期研究设计、目标人群入选标准、主要和次要研究目的、第16周疗效评价时点、样本量估计及不开展期中分析等事实撰写。需医学作者核对作用机制、非临床及既往临床证据是否在其他来源中提供。","review_advisories":["本节提及高影响设计信息（主要终点、期中分析、样本量）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。","本节重复了多项总体设计事实；建议压缩为与本节直接相关的信息。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_650a3ed48fbc8ff8","section_number":"2.4","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:307fc85bddcdf9ac984820c5","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:b5cb8043e0359e","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:367cbc36976ba5","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:7252de902642cb","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:d84680fc442c0c"]}],"source_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:307fc85bddcdf9ac984820c5","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:307fc85bddcdf9ac984820c5","source_type":"protocol_full_draft_selection","text_sha256":"97d014fb8606cbd66b6b61b1c6d22e1f2f4a827bd24db42d4a3e3d23092232ae"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","source_type":"current_project_study_definition","text_sha256":"787313a6f081b1c9afdf03800feb1c50c317aa4aa4f0c3884e924b0594e666da"},{"locator":"section:3.6.3.3 研究药物的计数|block:620|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:b5cb8043e0359e","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"5d7954edffb46be99638e2135e77631b0c5d64bf28fd8aeb9376a387c2a93b8f"},{"locator":"section:文档开头|block:26|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"33118fc6958419e645c6a0a19471c78f80e0c4c28be03b46f2b3e61d287e0305"},{"locator":"section:独立数据监查委员会|block:792|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:367cbc36976ba5","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"26824e050825b072ae0a7dd2eee48a5657c0d43ba2c463b531efc0feabf1a014"},{"locator":"section:文档开头|block:25|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:7252de902642cb","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"68663fd612a1770f44cc3c20e025cf77d568a22b8c10c9a906d5ceb40702d87e"},{"locator":"section:11.4 研究数据记录|block:1218|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:d84680fc442c0c","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"f7aafa4178dd21690460dacca369e7f10ae2fcf13e0a791098b68b6758b2984d"}]}